msgid "co:user"
msgstr "co:user"

#: ../../source/cmd_mode.rst:1
msgid ""
"La position porte un commentaire d'une provenance donnée : ``user`` "
"(écrit par vous), ``xg``, ``gnubg``, ``bgf`` (apporté par l'import d'un "
"match) ou ``unknown``. Répétable (``co:xg co:gnubg``)."
msgstr ""
"The position carries a comment of a given origin: ``user`` (written by "
"you), ``xg``, ``gnubg``, ``bgf`` (brought in by a match import) or "
"``unknown``. Repeatable (``co:xg co:gnubg``)."

